{
  "_doc": "s-galesling: Gale Sling extras (merged by gen_resources.py). files: the whirl item definition (using_item -> use_cycle over 4 frames of 2 ticks, one turn per 0.4 s) replacing the catalogue's plain one, the 4 whirl models, and the pebble item models the slung stone wears (minecraft:item_model on its stack). Textures: tools/gale_sling_art.py. Sounds re-use vanilla events (breeze whirl/shoot, stone/gravel hit).",
